1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[wind blowing]

2
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
and then, he scattered them everywhere.

3
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
[dramatic music playing]

4
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
[door creaks open]

5
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
[intense music playing]

6
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
If there are any conditions
for Komugi's safe return, speak.

7
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
[Palm] He knows exactly what we're doing.
Why try to fool him?

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:59,000
What I felt when sensing your En
was not wrath or fear, or hate.

9
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Shall I explain further?

10
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,000
It seems you doubt what you've just heard.
So, I'll say it again.

11
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
You are victorious. The battle is over.

12
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:34,000
-[gasps]
-I am here for a simple reason.

13
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,000
I have but one motive.

14
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
The human girl named Komugi.
We must speak.

15
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,000
There is truly nothing else
which I desire.

16
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Even knowing what will happen,

17
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
I have but one great desire,

18
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,000
and that is to spend
my remaining time with Komugi.

19
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
And nothing more.

20
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
No, it's not. It's impossible.

21
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:40,000
You expect me to believe you? Seriously?

22
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,000
in order to fool someone as lowly as me.

23
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:53,000
After all the killing that you've done
and that you plan to do,

24
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,000
a creature such as you…

25
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,000
The King admits defeat?
He cares for a human?

26
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,000
No! It doesn't make sense.

27
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
He's doing this because it's the truth!

28
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:10,000
I believe that it was
only a minimal change.

29
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,000
[Palm] Huh?

30
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:15,000
[Meruem] Something, somewhere… shifted.

31
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,000
If only I had been this way
from the beginning.

32
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:42,000
I wanted to ask you
instead of searching myself.

33
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
What are you saying?

34
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Stop this.

35
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,000
You're right.
I know exactly where Komugi is.

36
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:58,000
I don't think I have to tell you
that that is not a viable option now.

37
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Your aura is strong and as starkly
beautiful as any I have ever seen.

38
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,000
[Palm] Stop it!

39
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:11,000
All that I can do now
is to ask you for your assistance.

40
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,000
No, don't!

41
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,000
I know what you mean to us as a species,

42
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,000
to go to such lengths.

43
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,000
I'll tell you.

44
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,000
But on one condition.

45
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:10,000
May I use my ability to watch,

46
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
to see your final moments with her?

47
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:20,000
If that is what you require,
then you have my permission.

48
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:35,000
I wanted to,
but I couldn't keep our promise.

49
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,000
[imperceptible]

50
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,000
[breathing heavily]

51
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:30,000
[Komugi] 4-7-1, King.

52
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,000
Let's play.

53
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:50,000
[rotors whirring]

54
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:56,000
[reporter] We have a shocking
breaking news update.

55
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,000
The reason that the dictator
of East Gorteau

56
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,000
assembled the entire country in one place
for a rally

57
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:05,000
has been revealed by our sources
to be genocide.

58
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
on a national level.

59
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:16,000
It's been reported that the whereabouts
of Bizeff, Diego's second in command,

60
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,000
are currently unknown.

61
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:21,000
We have spoken to several
informed sources,

62
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
who say this could have been
a military takeover.

63
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:42,000
As you know, dark rumors have long
swirled around East Gorteau and the NGL.

64
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,000
[camera shutter clicking]

65
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,000
This incident may provide
the perfect opportunity

66
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,000
No, I wasn't there to see it go down.

67
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,000
Sorry, it's too complicated to explain.

68
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Anyway, we're waiting on Palm.

69
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
I'm sure one of your pencil pushers
would write a perfect follow-up report

70
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
if you really wanted.

71
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
I know how you guys are,

72
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:33,000
sitting at your comfortable desks,
in your air-conditioned rooms.

73
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
[sighs]

74
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:49,000
I'm afraid that logic simply won't fly
with the Vice-Chair camp.

75
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
[beeps]

76
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:10,000
[keyboard clacking]

77
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,000
Rest in peace.

78
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,000
You've certainly earned it.

79
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:32,000
[narrator] The same day,
a video was streamed online,

80
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,000
in which Netero announced his resignation

81
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,000
as chairman of the Hunter Association
effective immediately,

82
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:41,000
and gave instructions for choosing
his successor.

83
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:45,000
It was drowned out by other news
from the government-run media.

84
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:50,000
Only a select few understood
that it was his last will and testament.

85
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,000
[imperceptible]

86
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:56,000
[man] Come, raise a glass.

87
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:01,000
Let us drink to this creature
called "man."

88
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:24,000
That is why they yearn
and why they foster.

89
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:29,000
If they only knew
that all one needs in life is the sun,

90
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,000
ON A FARM, IN AN UNNAMED COUNTRY

91
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,000
[Palm] It's over.

92
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Well, then. It feels like you and I
haven't played in forever!

93
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Playing in real life is completely
different from playing in dreams.

94
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:17,000
-True.
-I could've sworn I felt someone kick me

95
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,000
really hard right in the stomach.

96
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:23,000
After that, there was this strange person
who kidnapped me.

97
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:29,000
And then, you must have saved me,
Dear Leader. So, thank you!

98
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:32,000
It wasn't me. Thank my guards.

99
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:34,000
Oh, no! I was wrong? I'm sorry!

100
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,000
I jumped to the wrong conclusion.

101
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,000
[Meruem] The fact is,
they were too good for me.

102
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:45,000
[Komugi] I'll have to remember
to thank them when they stop by.

103
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Okay!

104
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,000
My name is Komugi, Lord Meruem.

105
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
It's such a great honor
to make your acquaintance.

106
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:32,000
I know it is. But no…

107
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:35,000
that's a lie. I knew nothing.

108
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:41,000
The truth of the matter is,
I didn't understand what truly mattered.

109
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,000
Silence! If I beat you at Gungi,

110
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:02,000
you will no longer use the honorific.

111
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
[gasps]

112
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,000
[Komugi] I understand.

113
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:12,000
But if I address you without it,
is that when I die?

114
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,000
[Meruem] Ah, that's right.

115
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,000
There is no need for you to die.

116
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:26,000
So, you should be prepared
for innumerable losses.

117
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
1-5-1, King.

118
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
[Meruem] 2-7-2, cannon.

119
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:04,000
Could it be?

120
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,000
Komugi, are you mocking me?

121
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:19,000
-[Komugi] No.
-Choose your words carefully.

122
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
I will not tolerate nonsense.

123
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,000
No, it's Gungi.

124
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,000
I never joke when I play Gungi.

125
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:33,000
Very well.
You lose, and I will take your life.

126
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Yes.

127
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,000
[piece taps]

128
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,000
But all of them would only serve
to lengthen the game

129
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,000
without increasing her chances.

130
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,000
If she thinks there is an escape…

131
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Now show me, what lies beyond!

132
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,000
[Komugi] 4-6-2, shinobi.

133
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,000
[Meruem gasps] This is…

134
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:11,000
she won't be able to deflect
the cavalry and duke.

135
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,000
to somebody like me.

136
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:48,000
Is that possible? It doesn't feel right.

137
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:04,000
You see, I have been poisoned,

138
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,000
playing with you, Komugi.

139
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:22,000
But this poison, it's contagious.

140
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:28,000
Stay by my side too long,
and you will also…

141
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
[Komugi] Lord Meruem, I want you to know,

142
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,000
I'm so happy right now.

143
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:53,000
I may not be worthy,
but please let me go with you.

144
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:02,000
[Meruem] Yes, I see it now.

145
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:18,000
[Meruem]
This is why I was born, for this moment!

146
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:21,000
[serene music playing]

147
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:28,000
SHINOBI - KING

148
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,000
[imperceptible]

149
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,000
[Komugi] 6-5-1, cavalry.

150
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:02,000
[Meruem] 2-7-2, new shinobi.

151
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,000
Komugi, are you there?

152
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:35,000
[Meruem] It would appear that
I never defeated you.

153
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,000
[Komugi] 9-5-1, King.

154
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:56,000
[Meruem] Komugi, are you there?

155
00:21:56,000 --> 00:22:00,000
[Komugi] Of course, I am. Go ahead.
It's your turn, Lord Meruem.

156
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:07,000
[Meruem]
I feel rather tired. I shall sleep.

157
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,000
Just a short while.

158
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:26,000
[Komugi] I can hear you. All right.

159
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,000
Like this?

160
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:31,000
[Meruem] I shall wake up shortly.

161
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:53,000
-[Meruem] Thank you.
-[Komugi] You're welcome.

162
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:04,000
[Meruem] Will you say my name…
one last time?

163
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:17,000
[Komugi] Good night, Meruem.

164
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:24,000
It'll be all right.
I'll be joining you soon.

165
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,000
[upbeat music playing]

166
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Gon] Next time,
"Homecoming and True Name."

167
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:46,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
